-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Pre-registration documents (files under `preregistrations/`)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Released under CC BY 4.0 as well, with one condition that the licence itself does
not impose but the authors do: these documents are the frozen criteria the
experiments were designed against. **Do not edit them.** Fork and annotate if
you want to propose a change; the shipped bytes are the record.

